# Firebase service account key for FCM push — real secret, never commit.
# Leading wildcards matter: Firebase prefixes the filename with the project id
# (smashdraw-firebase-adminsdk-....json), so anchored patterns miss it.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json

# NOTE: google-services.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It ships inside the
